%% Context: Production incident runbook spanning on-call, engineering, and communications teams.
flowchart LR
  A([Alert fired]) --> B[On-call acknowledges]
  B --> C{Customer impact?}
  subgraph OnCall [On-call]
    C -->|No| D[Investigate and close]
    C -->|Yes| E{Severity 1 or 2?}
    E -->|No| F[Create incident channel]
    E -->|Yes| G[[Page incident commander]]
  end
  subgraph Engineering [Engineering]
    F --> H[Assign service owner]
    G --> H
    H --> I[Mitigate service]
    I --> J{Service restored?}
    J -->|No| K[Escalate specialist]
    K -.-> I
  end
  subgraph Communications [Communications]
    G --> L[Publish status update]
    J -->|Yes| M[Send resolution update]
  end
  J -->|Yes| N([Resolve incident])
  N --> O[Schedule postmortem]
  D --> N
  M --- N
